# CORE_UX — theming

Token-first kit. Details: `ai-instructions/theming.md`, `THEMING.md`, `doc/theming.html`.

## Rules

- All colours/shadows/radius → semantic **`--core-*`** variables in `styles/tokens.css`.
- `tailwind.preset.js` maps utilities to `var(--core-…)` — **no hardcoded hex** in preset.
- `styles/core-ux.css` uses `@apply` with **`core-*` utilities only** — no raw `gray-*`, `blue-*`, palette colours.
- New/changed tokens → update `THEMING.md`, `doc/theming.html`, and affected component doc pages. See `core-ux-documentation.mdc`.

## App theming (consuming apps)

- Scope overrides on **`.core-ux-root`** — load app theme **after** `dist/core-ux.css`.
- Override **`--core-*` variables**, not `.core-*` class rules.
- Apps must **not** patch kit CSS or rebuild CORE_UX for brand colours.

## Build

`npm run build` in CORE_UX → `dist/core-ux.css`. Apps run this via their own `prebuild` when kit styles change.
